  "semanticReview": [
    "Complete old/current seven production modules, all three actual state helpers and seven stable controls plus the complete new unit read. Pure current expressions, paid/data Cupid relation bodies, WolfBeauty Charm control and baseline/init/target/knowledge are unchanged.",
    "Captured Role canAct reads only permanent retirement as denial, never supplies original eligibility. Profiles keep original qualification/phase/tool/target/error order and append denial only at successful action tails, including nullable Charm.",
    "Cupid reads builder/args and prepared Reflect before refusal, builds request before original current and late provider/getAction reads. Hybrid/WolfBeauty retain provider/getAction before builder/args. Reflect/bind and args prepare before last flag, followed only by prepared invocation with original receiver.",
    "Non-callable original provider is not bound/validated early: builder completes or throws first, and TypeError occurs at actual invoke. Added Reflect TypeError text, global observation, allocation and call stack are explicit input/API changes, not arbitrary CJS/global equivalence.",
    "After gateway and original target/body/Victory reads, Hybrid and Charm capture original commit callee before last flag; unchanged data helpers begin with remaining or targetId assignment. Original getter errors still propagate before denial.",
    "Controlled bindLovers keeps has-binding error first, addComponent callee/record.actorId/args next, then Reflect preparation and last refusal before Lovers first component install. Default three-argument expression/void has no new Reflect/flag channel.",
    "After first Lovers install, Hybrid remaining write or Charm targetId write, original fields/bindings/Victory/facts complete without further tombstone. Late retirement and publication failure retain original paid prefix, no refund or recreated permit.",
    "Nine independent declarations have literal requests/stocks/Victory/Charm/Lovers/fact/Error oracles and real bootstrap/factory/gateway. Provider-retirement occurs in synchronous async-provider body then await-return revalidation, not an external deferred suspension."
  ],
